    "voices": [
      {
        "slot": "intro",
        "source": "voices/liu-dan/liu-dan__voice__intro__v1.wav",
        "nativeSource": "/Users/yuanfei/PieAI/SwimmerParty-Website/media-pack/library/staging/liu-dan/voice/handoff/liu-dan__voice__intro__v1.wav",
        "sha256": "6d4dd6dfdd01276d1eac3ea6a60a786430f0c78ef3c95aecc368d9b281454c2d",
        "bytes": 1065846,
        "version": 1,
        "transcript": "大家好，我叫刘丹，辽宁鞍山人，今年二十三。别看我才一米五六，我以前练举重的，现在在快递站分拣。搬箱子这活儿，真不一定谁比谁慢。下班一起吃口热乎的，比啥都强。"
      },
      {
        "slot": "intro-alt",
        "source": "voices/liu-dan/liu-dan__voice__intro-alt__v1.wav",
        "nativeSource": "/Users/yuanfei/PieAI/SwimmerParty-Website/media-pack/library/staging/liu-dan/voice/handoff/liu-dan__voice__intro-alt__v1.wav",
        "sha256": "b8d2086041a4c15ac78ea5e6568d6526e6cb695953e06425494cc867dc7d3236",
        "bytes": 1068918,
        "version": 1,
        "transcript": "Hi, I'm Liu Dan. I'm twenty-three, from Anshan in northeast China. I used to train in weightlifting, and now I sort parcels. I'm short, sure, but let me take that box. After work, I just want something hot to eat and a good laugh."
      },
      {
        "slot": "chat",
        "source": "voices/liu-dan/liu-dan__voice__chat__v1.wav",
        "nativeSource": "/Users/yuanfei/PieAI/SwimmerParty-Website/media-pack/library/staging/liu-dan/voice/handoff/liu-dan__voice__chat__v1.wav",
        "sha256": "29775fa7ab3808ca91afd0df1715b09a131457b1a06f6eae2562cae6fba09da9",
        "bytes": 688670,
        "version": 1,
        "transcript": "你先把那边的小件分好，大箱子留给我。哎，不用跟我客气，我以前练这个的。等忙完这一波，咱俩去吃碗面，我请你。"
      },
      {
        "slot": "happy",
        "source": "voices/liu-dan/liu-dan__voice__happy__v1.wav",
        "nativeSource": "/Users/yuanfei/PieAI/SwimmerParty-Website/media-pack/library/staging/liu-dan/voice/handoff/liu-dan__voice__happy__v1.wav",
        "sha256": "3abd995085d0fe42fb8b3b9c6baf79430aef07f27fec13d05bd0b9643b89ca01",
        "bytes": 655234,
        "version": 1,
        "transcript": "真让我赶上末班车了！我都以为今天又得走回去呢。来，你坐这儿，我站一会儿没事。哎呀，今天这运气，可算轮着我了！"
      },
      {
        "slot": "angry",
        "source": "voices/liu-dan/liu-dan__voice__angry__v1.wav",
        "nativeSource": "/Users/yuanfei/PieAI/SwimmerParty-Website/media-pack/library/staging/liu-dan/voice/handoff/liu-dan__voice__angry__v1.wav",
        "sha256": "ee555a472f1a8db6704e040d23b30e8c0e39ccabf6f957274a93cb7e9417c99f",
        "bytes": 622540,
        "version": 1,
        "transcript": "我说了多少遍，重箱子别往轻件上头摞！你图这两秒省事，东西压坏了谁负责？先停一下，跟我把这排重新分好。"
      },
      {
        "slot": "sad",
        "source": "voices/liu-dan/liu-dan__voice__sad__v1.wav",
        "nativeSource": "/Users/yuanfei/PieAI/SwimmerParty-Website/media-pack/library/staging/liu-dan/voice/handoff/liu-dan__voice__sad__v1.wav",
        "sha256": "487223d0b5c862d5b23895c6bbbf2ad5988bac9d996a9c63e52ce6a0e2c267fb",
        "bytes": 806814,
        "version": 1,
        "transcript": "刚才收拾柜子，翻出以前比赛那双鞋了。都磨成那样了，我还舍不得扔。其实现在也挺好，就是有时候，还真想再听一回开场的哨声。"
      }
    ]
